  "releaseNotes": "0.3.1: regenerated from the WebAPI v2 specification of 03.10.2026 — the XML documentation of the MT4 trade-transaction and bulk user-group fields lists the values the server accepts; an unknown value is refused with error code Validation instead of silently becoming the default. No API surface changes. Package project URL is https://mywebapi.com. Full notes: https://github.com/CPlugin/mywebapi.com-sdk-dotnet/blob/v0.3.1/CHANGELOG.md",
